<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Senha atualizada — Loov</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: #fafaf6; color: #28231c;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .card {
      width: 100%; max-width: 440px;
      background: #fefefd;
      border: 1px solid #e0dbd0;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 44px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(40,35,28,0.06);
    }
    .icon-wrap {
      width: 72px; height: 72px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: #d6ecde; border: 1px solid #b5d8c1;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #2d6b42; text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      background: #d6ecde;
      border: 1px solid #b5d8c1;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(24px, 4.5vw, 30px);
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      color: #28231c;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    h1 .accent { color: #dd7852; }
    p {
      color: #575148;
      font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon-wrap">
      <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2d6b42" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="eyebrow">SUCESSO</div>
    <h1>Senha <span class="accent">atualizada</span></h1>
    <p>Volte ao app Loov e faça login com a nova senha.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
